# The driver mobile app is a separate Expo/React Native project with its own
# node_modules and is shipped via Expo EAS, not Vercel. Keep it out of the web
# build entirely so it can never affect Next.js installs or builds.
mobile/

# The WhatsApp sender agent runs on the office PC, not on Vercel — it is a
# long-lived process that talks to a WhatsApp gateway on localhost, which is
# the one thing a serverless deploy cannot host. Excluded for the same reason
# as mobile/: it has no business in the web build.
agent/
